  "archivedBody": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-648eebb4f082a633e1fede24\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"ce104224ed1333641358\" id=\"block-ce104224ed1333641358\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>Originally published in </em><a href=\"http://ghostoceanmagazine.com/ghost-ocean-6\"><em>Ghost Ocean Magazine</em></a><em>, Issue 6</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>Also published in </em><a href=\"https://www.mikebagwell.me/or-else-they-are-trees\"><em>Or Else they are Trees</em></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-ce104224ed1333641358 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-ce104224ed1333641358 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-ce104224ed1333641358 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-ce104224ed1333641358 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-ce104224ed1333641358 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-ce104224ed1333641358 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-ce104224ed1333641358 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_4212\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          combination-animation-site-default\n          individual-animation-site-default\n          individual-text-animation-site-default\n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:2048px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n              class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n              data-animation-role=\"image\"\n              \n  \n\n          >\n            <div data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image-container class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\n              \n          \n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:78.857421875%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2048x1615\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1615\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/804d7889-e858-4e68-ad99-65ff0d58743f/ghost-ocean.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And Into the Poem</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">i.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">the storm put its lips to the hollowed-out<br>section of my chest and pulled in its lungs<br>to produce a long, clear note.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I have filed there, images of organs—<br>pen-scrawls of dense weed on cardboard—<br>in rows arranged like a harmonica<br>so that the wind can play the blues.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">ii.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">a stillness, wet like the skeletons of drowned men,<br>seeps through these open petals<br>and deposits itself in cold drops<br>like whole histories of mankind<br>at the tattered edges of cardboard<br>just below my skin.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">iii.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">there is awe.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">iv.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">-----------------------------------------------<br>--------------------------------------------------<br>---------------------------------</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">v.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">together we trained a mirror and drank more<br>than the dark unveiled. the small objects,<br>the tangled blades of grass, the unknowable stalks,<br>slipped like outstretched sinews from our tongues.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088052725_5150 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
  "excerpt": "the storm put its lips to the hollowed-out / section of my chest and pulled in its lungs / to produce a long, clear note."
}
